 "b-transaction-tf00060": "<p class=mut>Open the Sale screen from the menu and see what is on it.</p><div class=prep><p class=pt>Before you start</p><dl><dt>Where</dt><dd>Transaction &gt; Sale Transactions &gt; Sale</dd><dt>Who can do this</dt><dd>A user whose rights include this menu item</dd></dl></div><ol class=steps><li><span class=n>1</span><div class=sb>Click <b>Transaction</b> in the top bar, point to <b>Sale Transactions</b>, then click <b>Sale</b>. The green dot beside it means this screen is available.<br><img loading=lazy decoding=async src='/billing/0a72d2ef-1d5558601b1e095c.jpg' alt='Screenshot for step 1: Click Transaction in the top bar, point to Sale Transactions, then click Sale. The green dot beside it means this screen'></div></li><li><span class=n>2</span><div class=sb><b>Sale</b> opens in a tab under the top bar. Main controls: <b>Save sale (Ctrl+S)</b>, <b>Clear</b>, <b>Hold</b>, <b>Recall…</b>.<br><img loading=lazy decoding=async src='/billing/cca24bb3-77de37b9b19d210f.jpg' alt='Screenshot for step 2: Sale opens in a tab under the top bar. Main controls: Save sale (Ctrl+S), Clear, Hold, Recall….'></div></li></ol><h3>Fields on this screen</h3><table class=t><tr><th>Field<th>Required?<th>What to enter<th>Example</tr><tr><td>#<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>PRODUCT<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>BATCH<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>QTY<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>RATE<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>DISC %<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>GST<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>NET<td>Optional<td><td></tr></table>",
