 "b-reports-rf00030": "<p class=mut>Open the Stock Taking Report screen from the menu and see what is on it.</p><div class=prep><p class=pt>Before you start</p><dl><dt>Where</dt><dd>Reports &gt; Stock &gt; Stock Taking Report</dd><dt>Who can do this</dt><dd>A user whose rights include this menu item</dd></dl></div><ol class=steps><li><span class=n>1</span><div class=sb>Click <b>Reports</b> in the top bar, point to <b>Stock</b>, then click <b>Stock Taking Report</b>. The green dot beside it means this screen is available.<br><img loading=lazy decoding=async src='/billing/db6cd116-c3457dd55e524d2e.jpg' alt='Screenshot for step 1: Click Reports in the top bar, point to Stock, then click Stock Taking Report. The green dot beside it means this screen '></div></li><li><span class=n>2</span><div class=sb><b>Stock Taking Report</b> opens in a tab under the top bar. Main controls: <b>View</b>.<br><img loading=lazy decoding=async src='/billing/09b0c619-af90d89264d98c16.jpg' alt='Screenshot for step 2: Stock Taking Report opens in a tab under the top bar. Main controls: View.'></div></li></ol><h3>Fields on this screen</h3><table class=t><tr><th>Field<th>Required?<th>What to enter<th>Example</tr><tr><td>All records (ignore dates)<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>From<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>To<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>Product-wise<td>Optional<td><td></tr><tr><td>Batch-wise<td>Optional<td><td></tr></table>",
 "b-reports-sr00092": "<p class=mut>Open the Supplier Outstanding(Supplier Class) screen from the menu and see what is on it.</p><div class=prep><p class=pt>Before you start</p><dl><dt>Where</dt><dd>Reports &gt; Purchase &gt; Purchase &gt; Supplier Outstanding(Supplier Class)</dd><dt>Who can do this</dt><dd>A user whose rights include this menu item</dd></dl></div><ol class=steps><li><span class=n>1</span><div class=sb>Click <b>Reports</b> in the top bar, point to <b>Purchase</b> then <b>Purchase</b>, then click <b>Supplier Outstanding(Supplier Class)</b>. The green dot beside it means this screen is available.<br><img loading=lazy decoding=async src='/billing/8cb6a9d4-143fc7507079cfbd.jpg' alt='Screenshot for step 1: Click Reports in the top bar, point to Purchase then Purchase, then click Supplier Outstanding(Supplier Class). The gree'></div></li><li><span class=n>2</span><div class=sb><b>Supplier Outstanding(Supplier Class)</b> opens in a tab under the top bar. Main controls: <b>Filters</b>, <b>View</b>.<br><img loading=lazy decoding=async src='/billing/d617d80f-5f3345eae434df54.jpg' alt='Screenshot for step 2: Supplier Outstanding(Supplier Class) opens in a tab under the top bar. Main controls: Filters, View.'></div></li></ol>",
